        },
        "heading_zkFhw7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Discover Dunrobin Highland Distillery",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_p6VEtb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Established in 2025 by husband-and-wife team Boban and Lizzie Costin, Dunrobin Highland Distillery is a family-run Scottish gin distillery based in Golspie, Sutherland, in the heart of the North Highlands.</p><p>As the daughter of the Earl of Sutherland, Lizzie has a deep connection to&nbsp;Dunrobin Castle&nbsp;and the surrounding estate. Together, Lizzie and Boban have brought the heritage of distilling back to Sutherland Estates, creating a premium Highland gin inspired by the landscape, history and stories of the place they call home.</p><p>Crafted at Dunrobin Farm, just a short distance from Dunrobin Castle, Dunrobin Gin offers a way to experience a little of the Castle's magic, wherever you are.</p>"
          }
        },
        "button_daPBVF": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Discover our story",
            "link": "shopify://blogs/news/the-story-behind-dunrobin-highland-distillery-dunrobin-gin",
            "style": "link"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "eyebrow_brmCYB",
